each side, whose gap at the cutoff is the conventional estimate of a
sharp design (for a fuzzy one, the jump in the outcome, the numerator
of the ratio), and with \code{plac} the jump at each placebo cutoff with
its normal interval; it returns a list of what it drew (\code{bins},
\code{fit}, \code{placebo}).
